reconstructed research.md "Spike findings" (T018, 8.1.17: every ioLog listing of an account without the needed right) in the helper protocol (contracts/helper-protocol-delta.md "Frames") as ClientHelper writes it for op=ioLog, request processId=4711 workflow=Orders-Inbound without ref.
